It includes even more founder examples.

625
00:36:07,660 --> 00:36:09,180
We couldn't fit in this video.

626
00:36:09,180 --> 00:36:13,180
And it walks you through thought exercises to help you discover SaaS opportunities hiding

627
00:36:13,180 --> 00:36:14,300
at your work day.

628
00:36:14,300 --> 00:36:17,340
You can get your free copy at robwalling.com slash ideas.

629
00:36:17,340 --> 00:36:19,060
I hope you find it helpful.

630
00:36:19,060 --> 00:36:22,180
Once you've found your SaaS idea, the next step is validation.

631
00:36:22,180 --> 00:36:25,340
And that's exactly what I cover in this next video.

632
00:36:25,340 --> 00:36:28,740
If you found this video helpful, I'd appreciate it if you give it a like and subscribe to the

633
00:36:28,740 --> 00:36:29,740
channel.

